  "aggregation": "Score is the percentage of all sequences jointly satisfying pLDDT > 80, pTM > 0.8 and Repeat < 10%. pLDDT, pTM and PPL are arithmetic means over all sequences. Repetition metrics are mean per-sequence fractions multiplied by 100; no length-specific metric columns.",
